WEBVTT

00:11:58.005 --> 00:12:00.841
despite any concerns of copycats

00:12:00.883 --> 00:12:03.469
or intellectual property infringements,

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:06.138
because that's what you do

00:12:06.138 --> 00:12:08.974
when you benefit
from what came before you

00:12:09.016 --> 00:12:12.144
and you plan on passing it
along long after you.

00:12:13.312 --> 00:12:14.480
Thank you.

00:12:14.521 --> 00:12:17.775
(Applause)

00:12:17.816 --> 00:12:20.944
When you know you're here
to give, not take,

00:12:20.986 --> 00:12:23.822
and leave this place
better than you found it.

00:12:25.949 --> 00:12:28.827
See, mom, you can bake for a living.

00:12:28.827 --> 00:12:30.412
Pretty cool, if you ask me.